# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Manuscript work — deliberately NOT part of this repository.
#
# This repository publishes the Algametrix tool: the engine, the desktop app
# and their tests. The cross-study evidence layer, the reproduction pipeline
# and everything written for the manuscript stay local until the paper is
# submitted. Keep these entries until that decision is revisited: a plain
# `git add -A` would otherwise publish the manuscript.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Manuscript drafts, revision reports and handoff bundles
/paper_handoff/
/revision_handoff/
/revision_handoff_r2/
/handoff_zip/
/REVISION_REPORT.md
/00_START_HERE.md
*.zip

